        <member name="T:Brega.Loader.Game.SaveHook">
            <summary>
            Runs BregaMod.OnSave before the game saves. The game saves when a "Button" PlayMakerFSM on an object named SAVEGAME
            (the toilets/beds) sends the global SAVEGAME event and then loads MainMenu. We insert our action at index 0 of the
            state that sends SAVEGAME. Only FSMs that PlayMaker already initialised are patched (initialising reloads the
            actions from data and would drop ours); the rest are retried every second. Systems/InitializeControls also sends
            SAVEGAME (control config) and is never hooked.
            </summary>
        </member>
        <member name="M:Brega.Loader.Game.SaveHook.Tick(System.Boolean)">
            <summary>force = full scan of every FSM (once per GAME load); otherwise only the pending SAVEGAME FSMs are retried.</summary>
        </member>
